@ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress = http://localhost:5139
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Ping mínimo (sin BD, sin auth)
GET {{ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress}}/ping
Accept: application/json

###

### Debug ping (sin BD, sin auth)
GET {{ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress}}/api/debug/ping
Accept: application/json

###

### Debug info (sin BD, sin auth)
GET {{ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress}}/api/debug/info
Accept: application/json

###

### Health (sin BD, sin auth)
GET {{ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Login
# @name login
POST {{ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

###

### Register
POST {{ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuario": "nuevo_usuario",
  "password": "123456",
  "nombreCompleto": "Usuario Nuevo"
}

###

### Obtener todos los clientes
GET {{ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Buscar cliente por clave
GET {{ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/0001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Insertar cliente
POST {{ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress}}/api/clientes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clave": "0005",
  "nombre": "Juan Pablo Morales",
  "edad": 20,
  "fechaNacimiento": "2006-02-10"
}

###

### Actualizar cliente
PUT {{ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/0005
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Juan Pablo Morales Rivera",
  "edad": 21,
  "fechaNacimiento": "2005-02-10"
}

###

### Eliminar cliente
DELETE {{ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/0005
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Cliente no encontrado (404)
GET {{ApiBrindisJP_HostAddress}}/api/clientes/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
